from pathlib import Path
import json,re
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
S=R.parent/'health_value_ai_perspective'
D=json.loads((S/'content_bilingual.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
changes=[]
def para(page,index,zh,en):
    for lang,new in [('zh',zh),('en',en)]:
        old=D[lang]['pages'][str(page)][0]['paragraphs'][index]
        assert set(re.findall(r'\[@E\d+\]',old))==set(re.findall(r'\[@E\d+\]',new)),(page,index,lang)
        D[lang]['pages'][str(page)][0]['paragraphs'][index]=new
        changes.append({'language':lang,'page':page,'paragraph':index+1,'before':old,'after':new})
D['zh']['abstract']='加班带来的收入、便利饮食节省的时间、人工智能提高的任务效率，都容易计入收益；相伴的睡眠变化、身体负担和恢复时间却常被遗漏。本文结合健康资本、时间配置、健康可行能力与决策分析，提出健康后果比较框架。在共同期限内，框架比较现实可行的方案，分别记录资源与时间、健康与功能、主观体验、能力与自主性，并依据个人目标评价取舍。状态测量、结果预测和价值判断各有依据，各项结果保留原有单位、发生时点及不确定性。在 AI 使用中，这一区分尤其重要：任务提速未必增加休息，辅助表现改善也未必提高独立能力。本文以单日及连续加班、饮食选择和数字休闲为例，说明比较方法，并提出关于时间收益分配、效果持续性和决策质量的可检验命题。框架旨在帮助人们理解选择的条件与后果，允许不同处境下的个人保留不同偏好。'
D['en']['abstract']='Overtime pay, convenient meals and faster AI-assisted work offer visible gains in money or time. Changes in sleep, physical burden and recovery may receive less attention. Drawing on health capital, time allocation, health capability and decision analysis, this Perspective proposes a framework for comparing health-related consequences. It compares feasible options over a common horizon, recording resources and time, health and functioning, experience, and capabilities and agency before appraisal against personal priorities. Measurement, prediction and judgement remain distinct; outcomes retain their units, timing and uncertainty. For AI use, faster tasks need not create more rest, and better assisted performance need not improve independent ability. Cases involving daily and repeated overtime, food choices and digital leisure show how to apply the comparison. Testable propositions concern the distribution of time gains, persistence of effects and decision quality. The framework aims to clarify choices and their consequences while allowing priorities to differ across people and circumstances.'
para(2,0,'一笔加班费能否改善生活，要看收入增加了多少，也要看付出了什么。延长白天工作、连续上夜班和借助 AI 提高效率，都可能增加收入，却可能给睡眠、精力和家庭时间带来不同影响。比较从具体问题开始：钱增加了多少，时间花在何处，第二天还能否正常工作、学习或照顾家人。图 1 将这些问题纳入同一框架，图 2 区分测量、预测与评价。','Whether overtime pay improves daily life depends on both the income gained and what it requires. Longer daytime work, repeated night shifts and greater efficiency with AI may all increase income, with different implications for sleep, energy and family time. Comparison begins with concrete questions: how much money is gained, where time goes, and whether the person can work, study or care for family the next day. Figure 1 brings these questions together; Figure 2 separates measurement, prediction and appraisal.')
para(2,1,'既有理论为这一问题提供了不同切入点。Grossman 将健康视为兼具消费与生产作用的资本存量，Becker 将非市场时间纳入资源配置分析。[@E001][@E002] 马克思对工作日的讨论，则将劳动时间、议价关系与劳动力再生产联系起来。[@E003] 这些理论分别关注健康、时间和劳动关系，不能彼此替代。沿着马克思的思路，可以追问生产收益与健康负担由谁承担；具体的健康损失仍须依据劳动暴露及其替代方案来识别，不能直接作为剩余价值的一项实测数量。','Established theories offer different starting points. Grossman treats health as a stock with both consumption and production value; Becker brings non-market time into resource allocation. [@E001][@E002] Marx links the working day to bargaining and the reproduction of labour power. [@E003] These accounts address health, time and labour relations from distinct perspectives. Marx motivates questions about who receives production gains and who bears health burdens. Identifying a particular health loss still requires evidence about exposure and the feasible alternative; it cannot simply be added to surplus value as a measured quantity.')
para(2,2,'健康可行能力理论同时关注已经实现的健康状态，以及人们维护健康、追求自身目标的实际机会。[@E004] 对依赖加班收入支付住房或照护费用的人来说，有权拒绝加班，并不意味着有条件拒绝。健康状态也会改变收入对生活的意义，同额收入增量未必带来相同的福利改善。[@E005] 评价收入时，需要同时考察它缓解了哪些困难，以及为此付出的时间和健康代价。','Health capability concerns both achieved health and the real opportunities people have to maintain it and pursue their goals. [@E004] A person who needs overtime pay for housing or care may have the right to refuse without the means to do so. Health-dependent utility also means that the same income increment need not yield the same welfare gain in every health state. [@E005] Appraisal should therefore consider which difficulties the income relieves and the time and health costs of obtaining it.')
para(2,3,'本文所称健康经济价值，是健康与功能变化对资源配置和个人选择的意义，包括健康本身的价值及其对日常活动的支持。它不等同于赚钱能力、总体福利或人的价值。比较框架据此列出可行方案，追踪后果随时间的变化，并结合证据、不确定性和个人目标作出判断。比较可以得到明确的选择，也可以说明某项选择在什么条件下成立，或哪些分歧暂时无法消解。','We use health economic value to describe the significance of health and functioning for resource allocation and personal choice, including the value of health itself and its support for daily activities. It is distinct from earning capacity, total welfare and human worth. The framework specifies feasible alternatives, traces their consequences over time, and makes evidence, uncertainty and personal priorities explicit. A comparison may yield a preference, identify the conditions under which a choice is justified, or leave a disagreement unresolved.')
para(3,1,'货币估值可用于特定的政策和资源配置问题，补偿支付却不能证明身体功能已经恢复。即使某项损失难以逆转，人们仍需比较预防、缓解和其他可行安排。接受补偿也有不同原因：有人认为收益足以抵偿风险，有人则缺少维持生计的其他选择。行为福利分析因此要求关注选择发生的条件，不能把所有实际选择都视为充分知情的价值判断。[@E006]','Monetary valuation can inform defined policy and resource-allocation questions, but payment does not establish that lost functioning has been restored. Even when a loss is irreversible, people still compare prevention, mitigation and feasible alternatives. Acceptance of compensation can reflect a considered trade-off or a lack of other ways to meet essential needs. Behavioural welfare analysis therefore examines the conditions under which observed choices reveal informed preferences. [@E006]')
para(3,2,'成本—后果分析将不同结果并列呈现，多准则决策分析则明确评价标准及其权重。[@E009][@E008] 成熟的决策指南也会询问备选方案、价值取向和支持需求。[@E010] 本文在这些方法上增加具体记录：节约的时间用在何处，结果能持续多久，有无辅助时的功能有何差别，以及收益和负担由谁承担。这些项目构成表 1 的比较记录，其实际作用仍需与既有工具比较验证。','Cost–consequence analysis presents outcomes alongside one another, while multicriteria decision analysis makes criteria and weights explicit. [@E009][@E008] Established decision guides already elicit options, values and support needs. [@E010] Our proposal adds specific records of where saved time goes, how outcomes develop, how functioning differs with and without assistance, and who bears the consequences. Table 1 organizes these fields. Their usefulness must be tested against existing tools.')
para(3,4,'比较需要统一记录规则，也需要容纳不同偏好。收入、睡眠与家庭时间发生冲突时，应先列明得失，再考察改变优先顺序是否会改变选择。只有在量尺、权重、不确定性和重复计量问题得到合理处理后，汇总评分才有解释力。缺少可靠换算关系的结果，可保留各自单位，分别报告。','A common record should accommodate different priorities. When income, sleep and family time conflict, the comparison should show the trade-off and test whether changing priorities changes the choice. An overall score is interpretable only when scales, weights, uncertainty and double counting have been addressed. Outcomes without a defensible conversion can retain their own units and be reported separately.')
para(5,0,'任务效率是最直接的评价结果。Noy 和 Zhang 对 453 名专业人士开展的随机研究发现，AI 辅助提高了写作速度与产出质量。[@E011] Brynjolfsson 等研究了涉及 5,172 名客服人员的分阶段部署，双重差分主分析显示每小时解决问题数约提高 15%。[@E026] 后者属于准实验研究，测量的是工作效率，且未掌握薪酬数据。两项研究支持生产率收益，但节约的时间由谁支配、劳动者收入和健康是否改善，仍需另行测量。[@E026]','Task efficiency is the most direct outcome. Noy and Zhang found faster writing and better output in a randomized study of 453 professionals. [@E011] Brynjolfsson and colleagues examined a staggered rollout covering 5,172 customer-support agents; their main difference-in-differences estimate indicated about 15% more issues resolved per hour. [@E026] The latter study was quasi-experimental, measured throughput and lacked compensation data. These studies support productivity gains, but who controls the saved time, and whether income or health improves, require separate measurement. [@E026]')
para(5,1,'第二个层次是能力变化。辅助条件下完成任务，与撤去辅助后独立完成任务，需要分别测量。Bastani 等的教育实验说明，判断学习效果还需安排无辅助测评。[@E012] 评价应同时关注即时表现、独立表现和向陌生任务的迁移，不能据一项实验推断 AI 普遍损害认知。工具支持本身也有价值：即使独立能力未变，原本难以完成的活动变得可及，仍可能改善日常生活。','A second outcome is capability. Performance with assistance and performance after assistance is removed require separate measurement. Bastani and colleagues’ education experiment illustrates the need for an unaided assessment of learning. [@E012] Evaluation should cover immediate performance, independent performance and transfer to unfamiliar tasks; this experiment does not establish general cognitive harm from AI. Support itself also has value when it makes previously difficult activities accessible, even if unaided ability is unchanged.')
para(5,2,'第三个层次是收益的持续时间。De Freitas 等持续 7 天的第三项研究中，AI 陪伴带来的孤独缓解主要出现在互动后的即时测量，尚未证明互动前的孤独水平持续下降。[@E013] 组间退出差异和对照时长不匹配限制了结果解释。评价既应记录即时安慰，也应随访效果是否持续。对于短内容和虚拟互动，还可观察愉悦、睡眠、人际联系和能否自主结束使用；活动名称或使用时长本身不足以确定其价值。','A third outcome is how long a benefit lasts. In De Freitas and colleagues’ seven-day Study 3, loneliness relief appeared mainly in immediate post-interaction measures; persistent improvement before interaction was not demonstrated. [@E013] Differential attrition and an unmatched control duration limit interpretation. Evaluation should record immediate comfort and follow whether it lasts. For short-form content and virtual interaction, relevant outcomes also include enjoyment, sleep, relationships and the ability to stop. Activity labels or duration alone do not establish their value.')
para(5,3,'医疗建议还涉及信息如何转化为行动。Bean 等发现，使用者处理假设医疗场景时，未达到模型单独作答的表现；图 5d 展示对照组相对 AI 辅助组的病情识别结果。[@E014] 测量的是场景判断，并非实际患病结局。停用 Facebook 的研究同样关注平台使用之外的生活变化，但不能直接用于推断生成式 AI 的效应。[@E015] 健康素养导向 AI 强调理解、自主性、责任和相称性。[@E024] 将任务表现、持续能力和生活结果分别测量，可使这些要求落实为具体评价。','Medical advice also raises the question of how information becomes action. Bean and colleagues found that users handling hypothetical medical scenarios did not match the models’ standalone performance; Figure 5d shows identification in the control group relative to pooled AI assistance. [@E014] This measures scenario judgement, not clinical disease. Facebook-deactivation research likewise examines life beyond platform use, although its findings cannot directly establish generative AI effects. [@E015] Health-literate AI emphasizes comprehension, agency, accountability and proportionality. [@E024] Separate measures of task performance, sustained capability and daily outcomes help put these requirements into practice.')
para(6,0,'指标应随决策问题选择。比较一顿晚餐，可记录价格、准备时间和饱腹感；比较一个月的夜班，还需观察睡眠、白天功能和恢复安排。先确认方案可行、期限一致，再依据基线状况和主要关切选择指标，比罗列全部体检项目更有针对性。图 4 展示了从暴露到生活影响的测量层次。','Measures should follow the decision. A dinner comparison may need price, preparation time and satiety; a month of night work also calls for sleep, daytime functioning and recovery measures. Establish feasible alternatives and a common horizon, then select measures relevant to baseline conditions and the person’s concerns. Figure 4 distinguishes exposure, state and consequences for daily life.')
para(6,2,'血糖、血脂、血压、肌力、视力和皮肤症状各有测量对象，笼统的“血液质量”无法代替具体指标。数值变化需要结合基线、测量条件和适宜范围解释。皮肤不适和外观变化可以影响感受与交往，但不能仅凭肤色、头发或体形判断内部器官状态。身体与心理的联系也需要具体测量。健康差异反映人的处境，不应成为衡量其尊严与价值的尺度。','Glucose, lipids, blood pressure, strength, vision and skin symptoms measure different aspects of health; “blood quality” is too vague to replace them. Changes need interpretation against baseline, measurement conditions and appropriate ranges. Skin discomfort and appearance can affect experience and social life, but complexion, hair or body shape cannot establish internal organ status. Relationships between physical and psychological health also require measurement. Differences in health must not become a ranking of dignity or human worth.')
para(7,1,'将这些结果用于个人选择，须逐项核对研究人群、暴露、比较对象、结局和随访期限。它们说明劳动安排、饮食、睡眠及数字工具的某些后果可以测量；既不能据此验证整个框架，也不能把不同结局合并为个人的健康价格。图 5 保留各研究的单位和不确定性，供判断证据是否适用。','Applying these findings to personal choice requires checking the population, exposure, comparator, outcome and follow-up. They show that particular consequences of work, diet, sleep and digital tools can be measured. They do not validate the framework as a whole or supply a personal price for health. Figure 5 retains each study’s units and uncertainty so that readers can judge its relevance.')
para(8,3,'加班安排也可能协商：减少连续夜班、安排次日休息，或允许中途退出，都可作为新的备选方案。比较时既要考察能否满足收入需要，也要观察能否保留休息和重视的活动。这些安排的实际效果仍需评估。','Work arrangements may also be negotiable. Fewer consecutive night shifts, time off the next day or the ability to stop can be included as further options. Comparison should examine whether they meet income needs while preserving rest and valued activities. Their effects still require evaluation.')
para(9,1,'判断两方案的得失，还需知道每天加班多久、是否跨夜、原有健康状况、能否中止，以及收入是否用于必要支出。经济约束不同，选择可能不同，健康代价却仍应记录。因此，“10 万元是否值得”只能在这些条件下判断。法律或合同规定的支付处理责任与补偿问题，不能证明失去的身体功能已经恢复。','Appraisal also needs shift duration and timing, baseline health, the ability to stop, essential financial needs and the next-best feasible option. Different constraints may lead to different choices, while health costs still belong in the record. Whether CNY 100,000 is worthwhile can only be judged under these conditions. A legal or contractual payment addresses responsibility and compensation; it does not show that lost functioning has been restored.')
para(10,2,'准备一餐饭需要时间和劳动，家庭中由谁采购、烹调和清洗，应与食物开支一并记录。便利食品节约的时间也有价值。实际比较可从做得到的调整开始，例如改变可获得的菜品组合，或减轻准备负担，再观察饮食体验和相关结果。要求当事人先接受一种理想菜单，反而容易忽略其生活条件。','Preparing a meal uses time and labour. Who shops, cooks and cleans should be recorded alongside food spending and the time saved by convenience. A practical comparison can begin with feasible changes to available meal combinations or preparation burden, then observe the eating experience and relevant outcomes. Requiring an ideal menu at the outset can overlook the person’s circumstances.')
para(11,2,'评价 AI 陪伴时，也应分别记录即时支持和持续变化。已有研究观察到互动后的孤独缓解，但随访和对照设计仍限制了对长期效果的判断。[@E013] 在个人比较中，可以观察使用是否补充了原有支持、是否伴随推迟睡眠，以及能否按意愿结束互动。愉悦和支持本身有价值；记录后续变化，则有助于决定是否调整使用方式。','AI companionship should be assessed for both immediate support and sustained change. Studies have observed loneliness relief after interaction, while follow-up and comparator design limit conclusions about persistence. [@E013] A personal comparison can track whether use adds to existing support, accompanies delayed sleep and can be ended as intended. Enjoyment and support have value in themselves; observing subsequent changes can inform decisions about future use.')
para(12,0,'验证分为两部分：一是识别哪些机制改变了健康相关结果，二是检验比较框架是否帮助人们作出更充分知情的选择。前者为记录内容提供依据，后者检验工具的实际作用。图 10 展示两条研究路径，表 3 列出待检验命题及可能削弱它们的结果。','Validation has two parts: identifying mechanisms that change health-related outcomes, and testing whether the comparison framework improves informed choice. The first supplies evidence for the record; the second tests the tool’s usefulness. Figure 10 separates these research paths, and Table 3 lists propositions and findings that could weaken them.')
para(13,0,'个人选择受到工作规则、平台设计、住房、食物可获得性和照护责任的约束（图 11）。收入不稳定或工作量要求可能使休息难以实现，此时只强调自律，会遗漏限制选择的条件。比较框架可以揭示这些约束；扩大可行选项、改变议价关系，仍需要组织和公共政策的参与。','Work rules, platform design, housing, food access and care responsibilities constrain personal choices (Fig. 11). Income insecurity or workload demands may make rest difficult, so an emphasis on self-discipline alone misses the conditions limiting choice. The framework can reveal these constraints; expanding feasible options and changing bargaining conditions also require organizational and public-policy action.')
para(13,1,'评价还需明确站在谁的角度。劳动者净收入、企业产出、家庭无偿照护和公共支出应分别记录。一笔补偿对个人是收入，对社会则可能只是主体之间的转移；一个人节约的时间，也可能成为他人的核验、纠错或照护负担。比较个人、家庭与社会层面的结果，才能看清总量变化和实际承担者。','The perspective of the comparison must also be explicit. Workers’ net income, firms’ output, unpaid family care and public spending are separate entries. Compensation is income to a recipient but may be a transfer between parties at the societal level. Time saved by one person may become another’s checking, correction or care work. Comparing individual, household and societal outcomes shows both aggregate change and who bears it.')
para(13,3,'本文将健康相关后果、发生时间和承担者纳入同一比较过程。AI 使用使这些问题更为突出：任务做得更快，未必意味着独立能力增强或生活改善。共同的记录规则有助于讨论这些差异，同时允许人们保留不同偏好。框架能否在既有方法基础上改善解释、预测或决策质量，仍须通过研究检验。','This Perspective brings health-related consequences, their timing and their distribution into one comparison. AI use makes these questions pressing because faster task performance need not improve independent capability or daily life. A shared record can make such differences explicit while allowing personal priorities to vary. Whether the framework improves explanation, prediction or decision quality beyond existing methods remains an empirical question.')
para(13,4,'本文通过叙述性整合，联系经济理论、测量工具与代表性实证研究，提出一个仍待验证的框架。测量范围扩大可能增加负担，群体结果未必适用于个人，偏好也可能随处境改变。后续研究应先检验具体场景中的可行性，再与既有决策支持工具比较，观察理解和选择是否获得持续改善。','This conceptual Perspective draws together economic theory, measurement approaches and selected empirical studies through narrative synthesis. The proposed framework remains unvalidated. Broader measurement may add burden, population effects may not apply to individuals, and priorities can change with circumstances. Context-specific feasibility studies should precede comparison with established decision support, with follow-up to assess whether gains in understanding and choice persist.')
para(6,4,'每项比较都应分清观察结果、预测和未知项。未测量不等于没有影响；没有适用的基线风险，也不能把相对效应换算为个人的绝对风险。证据、处境或个人目标改变后，应重新审视原有判断。','Distinguish observations, predictions and unknowns. An unmeasured effect is not zero; relative effects cannot yield personal absolute risks without applicable baseline risks and models. Keep personal priorities alongside the evidence, and revisit the comparison when circumstances or outcomes change.')
para(12,1,'工作场所研究可结合任务日志、全天时间日记和重复测量，记录节约时间的去向及工作量、日程的决定权。组织政策随机试验或可信的自然实验有助于识别因果关系；单纯比较 AI 使用者与非使用者，仍受岗位选择、工作负荷、原有健康和反向因果影响。机制分析应预先设定，避免机械控制干预后的时间变量而遮蔽总效应。','Workplace studies could combine task logs, whole-day diaries and repeated outcomes with measures of control over workload and schedules. Randomized policies or credible natural experiments would strengthen causal inference. Simple user–non-user comparisons remain vulnerable to job selection, workload, prior health and reverse causation. Prespecified mechanism analyses should avoid obscuring total effects through mechanical adjustment for post-treatment time use.')
para(12,2,'工具评价宜采用主动对照：两组获得相同事实和成熟决策指南，干预组另加时间、后果与不确定性记录。决策质量研究和 Cochrane 综述可为对照及结局选择提供依据。[@E021][@E022] 主要结局应在招募前确定，由独立评分者评价理解程度；陌生情境中的运用、选择与个人价值的一致性，以及对不确定性的把握，可作为次要结局。','Tool evaluation should use an active comparator: identical evidence and an established guide, with only the intervention group receiving the added record of time, consequences and uncertainty. Decision-quality research and the Cochrane review inform comparator and outcome selection. [@E021][@E022] Prespecify understanding as a potential primary outcome with independent scoring; transfer, values–choice concordance and calibrated uncertainty can be secondary outcomes.')
para(12,3,'还需记录完成时间、退出、焦虑、可及性和停止使用者的体验。重复使用可能带来学习、疲劳或决策变化。预注册方案应说明目标人群、目标效应、样本量依据、缺失数据和多重比较处理。访谈可以解释理解或分歧，不能替代因果估计。若新增记录未带来实质收益，或负担超过收益，应简化或停止使用；选择更符合研究者的生活偏好，不能作为成功标准。','Record completion time, attrition, anxiety, accessibility and withdrawals’ experiences. Repeated use may bring learning, fatigue or changed decisions. Preregister the population, target effect, sample-size basis, missing-data analysis and multiplicity handling. Interviews can explain understanding or disagreement, but cannot replace causal estimates. Simplify or discontinue a module without meaningful net benefit. Choices closer to the researchers’ preferred lifestyle alone do not establish success.')
# Small local edits preserve substantive qualifications and technical punctuation.
for lang in ['zh','en']:
    for secs in D[lang]['pages'].values():
        for sec in secs:
            sec['paragraphs']=[t.replace('。 研究','。研究') for t in sec['paragraphs']]
    for n,t in D[lang]['captions'].items():
        if lang=='en':t=re.sub(r'(<b>)(?:Figure|Fig\.) (\d+)',r'\1Fig. \2',t)
        t=t.replace('</b>情境','</b> 情境')
        D[lang]['captions'][n]=t
D['en']['captions']['6']='<b>Fig. 6 | Daily income and overnight schedules.</b> Conceptual illustration of hypothetical schedules. With CNY 200 base pay and additional net supplements of CNY 400 or 1,000, totals are CNY 600 or 1,200.'
D['zh']['captions']['6']='<b>图 6 | 当天收入与夜间安排。</b> 假设情境插画。日薪为 200 元，额外净补贴分别为 400 元和 1,000 元，对应总收入为 600 元和 1,200 元。'
D['en']['tables']['2']['rows'][2][2]='Causal assumptions; allocation of saved time not measured'
(R/'content_bilingual.json').write_text(json.dumps(D,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')
